cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Three-stage computer-vision pipeline for ovarian carcinoma diagnosis from transvaginal ultrasound in postmenopausal women"
abstract: >
  Source code for a three-stage computer-vision pipeline that combines
  EfficientNet-B7 normal-versus-pathological triage, YOLOv8m cyst
  localisation, and benign-versus-malignant classification fusing CNN
  embeddings with eleven SAM-derived morphological features. Trained and
  evaluated on 1,082 transvaginal ultrasound images from 260 postmenopausal
  women at Meir Medical Center.
